      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Raising the five positive choices to the sixth power preserves their order and gives, respectively, \\[ \\begin{aligned} 30,\\qquad &6^3\\cdot5=1080,\\\\ 5^3\\cdot6&=750,\\\\ 5^2\\cdot6&=150,\\qquad 6^2\\cdot5=180. \\end{aligned} \\] The largest is the second.\n\nThus the correct answer is B.",
